<title>PORTUGAL: Portuguese bonds end down on France, EMU jitters.</title>
<headline>Portuguese bonds end down on France, EMU jitters.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bonds ended lower as speculation that France would face a snap elections unleashed fresh uncertainty over monetary union. Escudo weak and more bond downside seen. *June 97 futures down 26 at 106.73 *Feb 07 cash 98.98 vs 99.00. Yld 6.77 vs 6.76 *Spread vs Spanish 10-yr cash -18 bps vs -14 bps</p>
</text>
